        "Title": "Elon&apos;s Musk",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110861332564",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f3a43486-27cb-489e-be07-8f8fde47e638).Image",
        "Description": "A con artist impersonating Elon Musk as well as some of his subordinates are hiding away in a Japanese hospital. \rJames Carey, the ringleader, ate too much sushi and now has a constant upset stomach. He should be eliminated in a way that makes it look like an accident.\rRay Miller, his second-in-command, can be found in the restaurant. According to our intel, Ray also has a craving for sushi. Use this to your advantage.\rLastly, there are two underlings that can be dealt with as you see fit.",
